    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, crisp headline contrast, restrained cyan/red palette, and polished cards. However, desktop has excessive dead space and a weakly connected diagram; tablet becomes disproportionately tall with floating connector lines; mobile loses the brand name and diagram relationships, leaving a long stack of visually similar cards. Tiny, low-contrast mono labels and the clipped horizontal header navigation further reduce refinement.",
